    "chunk_text": "\u00fea & he \u00fea geseah, \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00fee heora yldost w\u00e6s, in sumum d\u00e6le \u00fe\u00e6re stowe ges\u00e6t. \u00dea ongan he acsian synderlice \u00feara \u00feegniendra gasta gehwylcne, hw\u00e6t he gedon h\u00e6fde, & he & \u00fea \u00feara awyrgedra gasta gehwylc his acsunge synderlice gerehton, hw\u00e6t hi wi\u00f0 godum \u00dea se awyrgda gast, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r yldost w\u00e6s, \u00feis geornlice gehyrde, & he gelyfde, \u00fe\u00e6t hit him \u00fee mare \u00dea gyt se ylca gast, se \u00fee \u00feas wisan anddette & ypte, he to geecte & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: \u00fe\u00e6t ic him n\u00e6fre On \u00e6fentid ic geteah his mod to \u00feon, \u00fe\u00e6t he lufode mid his bradre hand \u00fea nunnan & ofer \u00fea \u00dea se awyrgda gast & se ealda feond \u00feyses menniscan cynnes hine geornlice mid li\u00f0um wordum & \u00fea se Iudeisca man, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r to com, w\u00e6ccende \u00feis sceawode, & for mycelre nearonesse fyrhto \u00dea w\u00e6ron hi wundriende & cw\u00e6don: walawa. \u00deis is \u00e6mtig f\u00e6t & gesegnod. Hi \u00fea \u00feis eft heora aldre s\u00e6don, & \u00fea sona eall seo m\u00e6nigu \u00feara awyrgedra gasta onweg gewat. & \u00fea hra\u00f0e se Iudeisca man aras, \u00fee \u00feis eall geseah, & to \u00feam biscope ferde & hine \u00fea in his \u00dea scamode \u00feone biscop & nolde him \u00fea his costunge geandettan. \u00dea s\u00e6de se Iudeisce man him, \u00fe\u00e6t he beheolde \u00fea nunnan & mid unrihtre his",
